<section class="settings-card-form narrow"><h2>Statuses &amp; reminders</h2><p class="helper-text">Enquiry and booking statuses are built into the admin workflow and cannot be switched off here. Change an individual record from its details screen.</p><div class="single-admin"><strong>Reminders are manual</strong><p>Setting a reminder adds it to the record. The panel does not send automatic reminder messages.</p></div></section>
